---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Not what's known. What isn't.">
<h1 class="serif-h text-4xl">Not what's known. What isn't.</h1>
<p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl">Give the Unknown Engine a topic — plus optional papers — and it maps the open questions, contested claims, and methodological gaps in your literature, each tied to a source sentence for your review.</p>
<div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3">
<div class="border border-slate-200 p-4"><p class="font-bold">1. Analyse a topic</p><p class="text-sm opacity-70">Topic only, or upload PDFs/TXT.</p></div>
<div class="border border-slate-200 p-4"><p class="font-bold">2. Map the gaps</p><p class="text-sm opacity-70">Six categories, confidence scored.</p></div>
<div class="border border-slate-200 p-4"><p class="font-bold">3. Draw the boundary</p><p class="text-sm opacity-70">Established vs unknown, side by side.</p></div>
</div>
<h2 class="serif-h mt-8 text-2xl">Example gap map</h2>
<div class="mt-3 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2">
<article class="border border-slate-200 p-4"><p class="mono-n text-xs text-teal">OPEN_QUESTION</p><blockquote class="serif-quote mt-2">“Further research is needed on long-term sleep restriction effects.”</blockquote><p class="mono-n mt-1 text-xs opacity-70">confidence 0.8</p></article>
<article class="border border-slate-200 p-4"><p class="mono-n text-xs text-teal">CONTESTED_CLAIM</p><blockquote class="serif-quote mt-2">“Caffeine improves memory consolidation — contradicted across two sources.”</blockquote><p class="mono-n mt-1 text-xs opacity-70">confidence 0.7</p></article>
<article class="border border-slate-200 p-4"><p class="mono-n text-xs text-teal">METHODOLOGICAL_GAP</p><blockquote class="serif-quote mt-2">“No control group was used in the pilot study design.”</blockquote><p class="mono-n mt-1 text-xs opacity-70">confidence 0.65</p></article>
<article class="border border-slate-200 p-4"><p class="mono-n text-xs text-teal">REPLICATION_NEEDED</p><blockquote class="serif-quote mt-2">“A single small-sample trial supports the headline effect.”</blockquote><p class="mono-n mt-1 text-xs opacity-70">confidence 0.6</p></article>
</div>
<a href="/analyse" class="mt-6 inline-block underline">Analyse your topic</a>
</BaseLayout>
